"arial, sans-serif\">   <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span> Tru ~ Exp + Sat</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:13.2px Monaco;color:#b01300\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">   <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span> Sat ~ Exp</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:13.2px Monaco;color:#b01300\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">   <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span> Loy ~ Exp</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:13.2px Monaco;color:#b01300\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">   <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span> Loy ~ Sat</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:13.2px Monaco;color:#b01300\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">         Loy ~ Tru </font></p></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div> Loy =~</div><div>    Com     1.000</div><div>    Rec     0.927    0.087   10.703    0.000</div><div><br></div><div>Regressions:</div><div>  Tru ~</div><div>    Exp         0.124    0.033    3.803    0.000</div><div>    Sat          0.769    0.114    6.761    0.000</div><div>  Sat ~</div><div>    Exp         0.293    0.034    8.651    0.000</div><div>  Loy ~</div><div>    Exp         0.108    0.033    3.225    0.001</div><div>    Sat          0.610    0.180    3.377    0.001</div><div>    Tru          0.316    0.134    2.350    0.019</div></div>"
