     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>Here&#39;s my full syntax:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div> </div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:13.2px Monaco\">my.model<span style=\"color:#1e1699\"> &lt;- </span><span style=\"color:#b01300\">&#39;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:13.2px Monaco;color:#b01300\">   # Latente Variablen</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:13.2px Monaco;color:#b01300\">     Tru =~ Var29+ Var30+ Var31+ Var32+ Var33+ Var34 </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:13.2px Monaco;color:#b01300\">     Exp =~ Var9+ Var10+ Var11+ Var12+ Var15+ Var16+ Var17</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:13.2px Monaco;color:#b01300\">     Sat =~ Var18+ Var19+ Var20+ Var21+ Var22+ Var23+ Var24</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:13.2px Monaco;color:#b01300\">     Com =~ Var35+ Var36+ Var37+ Var40  </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:13.2px Monaco;color:#b01300\">     Rec =~ Var42+ Var43+ Var44+ Var45</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:13.2px Monaco;color:#b01300\">     Loy =~ Com + Rec</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:13.2px Monaco;color:#b01300;min-height:17.0px\">                </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:13.2px Monaco;color:#b01300\">   # Regression </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:13.2px Monaco;color:#b01300\">     <span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Tru ~ Exp + Sat</span></p><span style=\"color:rgb(80,0,80)\"><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;border-top-width:0px;border-right-width:0px;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-width:0px;border-style:initial;border-color:initial;vertical-align:baseline\"><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;border-top-width:0px;border-right-width:0px;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-width:0px;border-style:initial;border-color:initial;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font:normal normal normal 13.2px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(176,19,0)\"><font style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;border-top-width:0px;border-right-width:0px;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-width:0px;border-style:initial;border-color:initial;vertical-align:baseline\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">   <span style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;border-top-width:0px;border-right-width:0px;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-width:0px;border-style:initial;border-color:initial;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre\">\t</span> Sat ~ Exp</font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;border-top-width:0px;border-right-width:0px;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-width:0px;border-style:initial;border-color:initial;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font:normal normal normal 13.2px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(176,19,0)\"><font style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;border-top-width:0px;border-right-width:0px;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-width:0px;border-style:initial;border-color:initial;vertical-align:baseline\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">   <span style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;border-top-width:0px;border-right-width:0px;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-width:0px;border-style:initial;border-color:initial;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre\">\t</span> Loy ~ Exp</font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;border-top-width:0px;border-right-width:0px;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-width:0px;border-style:initial;border-color:initial;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font:normal normal normal 13.2px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(176,19,0)\"><font style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;border-top-width:0px;border-right-width:0px;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-width:0px;border-style:initial;border-color:initial;vertical-align:baseline\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">   <span style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;border-top-width:0px;border-right-width:0px;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-width:0px;border-style:initial;border-color:initial;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre\">\t</span> Loy ~ Sat</font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;border-top-width:0px;border-right-width:0px;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-width:0px;border-style:initial;border-color:initial;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font:normal normal normal 13.2px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(176,19,0)\"><font style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;border-top-width:0px;border-right-width:0px;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-width:0px;border-style:initial;border-color:initial;vertical-align:baseline\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">         Loy ~ Tru </font></p><div><font style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;border-top-width:0px;border-right-width:0px;border-bottom-width:0px;border-left-width:0px;border-style:initial;border-color:initial;vertical-align:baseline\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><br></font></div></div></span>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:13.2px Monaco;color:#b01300\">&#39;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 4.0px;font:13.2px Monaco;color:#1e1699;min-height:17.0px\"><br></p></div></div></div></blockquote></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>I don&#39;t see a call to lavaan in your R syntax, so I&#39;m still not sure how you identify your constructs (e.g., <a href=\"http://std.lv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://std.lv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792432039041000&amp;usg=AOvVaw21ubmqnyUd_jYewXAqXwjT\">std.lv</a> = TRUE?).  But I would think you might have trouble identifying a second-order construct with only 2 first-order constructs.  You don&#39;t gain any information by doing this, and it might be necessary to identify Loy either by fixing the latent variance of Loy to 1, and constraining its loadings on Com and Rec to equality.  Or to identify Loy by fixing by loadings to 1 and freely estimating its variance, which would be identical to the estimated (residual) covariance between Com and Rec if you were to exclude Loy from the model.<br><br>Terry<br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
